# `client/rs` (cache and engine ports)

- This tree is a port of OSRS cache loaders, CS2, scene, and models. The server compiles much of it (`server/tsconfig.json` include, CS2 excluded).
- Change it only to match cache/protocol behavior or to fix a proven loader bug. Do not rename, reformat, or “modernize” for style.
- ESLint already relaxes unused-vars / eqeqeq here. Do not “fix” those to satisfy general TypeScript taste.
- Client app behavior belongs in `client/game`, `client/network`, `client/widgets`, or `client/render`, not by wrapping new gameplay inside `rs/`.
